BIG Mistake #1.  If you want to fight a foo-Lich without having MR,
remember to burn/engrave Elbereth or use a scroll of scare monster. 
It will not curse your stuff or freeze your potions if you do that. 
It will summon monsters/nasties, however.

If you've got something against Elbereth/scare monster, there are just
a few safe ways of fighting liches without MR.  Best choice is
probably sitting on the upstairs and reading a scroll of earth, then
throwing daggers or firing arrows.  Remember liches regenerate, so you
have to dish out a lot of damage for a sustained period of time. 
Instakill with cockatrice corpse/eggs is also recommended.  Or, when
the lich teleports away, you can use a wand/spell to dig down and
escape.

